      "body": "**Yùhuáng** ​belongs ‌to ‌​the ​Chinese ​tradition, ​where ​it ‌​is ​associated ‌with ​jade ‌emperor, ​‌heaven, ​sovereignty.[^1]\n\n​### ​Jade ​Emperor\n\n​‌The ​central ‌domain ​of ‌​Yùhuáng ‌in ​the ‌chinese ​tradition.\n\n​‌### ‌Jade ‌Emperor\n\n​The ​name ‌​signifies ​\"Jade ‌Emperor\".\n\n​### ​Unicode ‌​Restoration\n\n‌The ​restoration ​Yùhuáng ​recovers ​‌what ‌plain ​ASCII ‌yuhuang ​flattens.\n\n​‌### ‌Original ‌Attestation\n\n‌Attested ​in ‌​the ​sources ​as ‌玉皇. ​​Yùhuáng's ​domain ‌is ​the ​celestial ​‌court ​itself: ‌law, ​destiny, ‌and ​‌the ‌moral ​ledger ​that ​determines ​‌fortune ‌and ​rebirth.[^1]",
